@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam actorBorderColor #17324D
skinparam actorFontColor #17324D
skinparam usecase {
 BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
}
skinparam rectangle {
 BorderColor #94A3B8
 FontColor #17324D
}
title Resumefolio | Policy and operational evidence use cases
actor "Policy-authorized administrator" as admin
actor "Evidence-authorized actor" as reader
rectangle "Resumefolio | System boundary" {
 usecase "Change effective file policy\nUC-D11-POLICY" as policy [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d11-policy]]
 usecase "Inspect permitted operation evidence\nUC-D11-EVIDENCE" as evidence [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d11-evidence]]
}
admin -- policy
reader -- evidence
legend bottom
Sources: AFO-D01/D02/D09/D10 and UC-D11 refinements.
Policy editing and evidence access require their own applicable grants.
Administration does not imply unrestricted private-content access.
Associations show proposed external interactions, not permission grants.
No include/extend dependency or actor inheritance is asserted.
endlegend
@enduml
